OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is it costing #1.5m to
OL,4,Ainvestigate mine shaft under tram
OL,5,Atracks?
OL,6,
OL,7,FEmergency investigation and repair work
OL,8,Fcosting #1.5m is taking place at a mine
OL,9,Fshaft which has opened up underneath
OL,10,FSheffield tram tracks.
OL,12,FThe Supertram route between Gleadless
OL,13,FTownend and Halfway was suspended in
OL,14,FAugust after a sinkhole appeared.
OL,16,FEngineering experts Volker Rail have
OL,17,Fbeen brought in to undertake work on
OL,18,Fthe outbound track at Birley Lane after
OL,19,Fpart of the tracks fell down the shaft.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
