OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is it costing #1.5m to
OL,4,Ainvestigate mine shaft under tram
OL,5,Atracks?
OL,6,
OL,7,FSouth Yorkshire Mayoral Combined
OL,8,FAuthority (SYMCA), which controls the
OL,9,Ftram network, said original cost
OL,10,Festimates were between #750,000 and
OL,11,F#1m, but following initial site
OL,12,Finvestigations, the expected bill is
OL,13,Fnow nearer #1.5m.
